{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/887880/extras/3a043dca8fbd035ff0762549f6978152.avif?t=1736971143\" width=560 height=180 /></span><br><br><br><strong>On Completeness &amp; Dissonance</strong> is a game about satisfying your inner perfectionist: make each pattern complete by rotating the board so the loose tiles can slide into the empty slots.<br><br>Sounds easy?<br>It is.<br><br>Enduring the painful sight of a tiled pattern corrupted by a single misplaced or misaligned tile?<br>Not so much.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>60 potentially brain-halting levels, with 60 more available through DLC;<br></li><li>10 elements introduced gradually, including high-voltage dischargers, antitiles and wormholes;<br></li><li>Don't panic as you try to beat each level with as few moves as possible within a time limit;<br></li><li>Mouse + keyboard and game controller supported;</li></ul><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/887880/extras/a55e70d5fba59ab8d85726d35020722f.avif?t=1736971143\" width=560 height=185 /></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"100911dbfa10c3f5d6fdf44496fbfb84d95c9d26.jpg","localized_name":"Again. And again. And again.","name":"Again. And again. And again.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/887880/100911dbfa10c3f5d6fdf44496fbfb84d95c9d26.jpg"},{"icon":"e46ed9734133e6adede1ec2247e7e78da7c3ed68.jpg","localized_name":"Ten First Times","name":"Ten First Times","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/887880/e46ed9734133e6adede1ec2247e7e78da7c3ed68.jpg"},{"icon":"1c15a46accbdf6cf0fbd34c37752b54148965796.jpg","localized_name":"Bottom of the Barrel","name":"Bottom of the Barrel","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/887880/1c15a46accbdf6cf0fbd34c3